"linkend=\"git\"/> (for downloading test files), <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/> "
"and <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"curl\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gdk-pixbuf\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"git\"/> (para baixar arquivos de teste), <xref linkend=\"gtk-"
"doc\"/> e <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Poppler"
msgstr "Instalação do Poppler"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, install <application>Poppler</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, Instale <application>Poppler</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release   \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr  \\\n"
"      -D TESTDATADIR=$PWD/testfiles \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_QT5=OFF             \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_UNSTABLE_API_ABI_HEADERS=ON \\\n"
"      -G Ninja ..                   &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release   \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr  \\\n"
"      -D TESTDATADIR=$PWD/testfiles \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_QT5=OFF             \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_UNSTABLE_API_ABI_HEADERS=ON \\\n"
"      -G Ninja ..                   &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order to run the test suite, some testcases are needed and can be "
"obtained only from a git repository. The command to download them is: "
"<command>git clone --depth 1 https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/poppler/test.git"
" testfiles</command>.  Then issue: <command>LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8 ninja "
"test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de executar a suíte de teste, alguns casos de teste são "
"necessários e podem ser obtidos somente a partir de um repositório git. O "
"comando para baixá-los é: <command>git clone --depth 1 "
"https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/poppler/test.git testfiles</command>. Em "
"seguida, emita: <command>LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8 ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:184
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:187
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To install the documentation, run the following commands as <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"
msgstr ""
"Para instalar a documentação, execute os seguintes comandos como <systemitem"
" class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:194
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d           /usr/share/doc/poppler-&poppler-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -vr ../glib/reference/html /usr/share/doc/poppler-&poppler-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d          /usr/share/doc/poppler-&poppler-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -vr ../glib/reference/html /usr/share/doc/poppler-&poppler-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:198
#, xml-text
msgid "Poppler Data"
msgstr "Dados Poppler"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:201
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you downloaded the additional encoding data package, install it by "
"issuing the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Se você baixou o pacote adicional de dados de codificação, [então] instale-o"
" emitindo os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:205
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../../poppler-data-&poppler-data-version;.tar.gz &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd poppler-data-&poppler-data-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../../poppler-data-&poppler-data-version;.tar.gz &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd poppler-data-&poppler-data-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:212
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make prefix=/usr install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make prefix=/usr install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:220
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release</parameter>: This switch is used to "
"apply a higher level of compiler optimizations."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para "
"aplicar um nível mais alto de otimização à compilação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:225
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D TESTDATADIR=$PWD/testfiles</parameter>: Tells the test "
"programs where the auxiliary files are located."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D TESTDATADIR=$PWD/testfiles</parameter>: Informa aos "
"aplicativos de teste onde os arquivos auxiliares estão localizados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_QT5=OFF</parameter>: This switch is needed to prevent "
"an error when Qt5 is not installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_QT5=OFF</parameter>: Essa chave é necessária para "
"evitar um erro quando o Qt5 não estiver instalado."

#. (e.g. <application>
#. Inkscape</application>).
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_UNSTABLE_API_ABI_HEADERS=ON</parameter>: Installs some "
"old <application>Xpdf</application> headers required by certain programs."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_UNSTABLE_API_ABI_HEADERS=ON</parameter>: Instala alguns"
" cabeçalhos antigos do <application>Xpdf</application> exigidos por certos "
"aplicativos."

#. and Pygments
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:241
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_GTK_DOC=ON</option>: Use this parameter if GTK-Doc is "
"installed and you wish to rebuild and install the API documentation."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_GTK_DOC=ON</option>: Use esse parâmetro se o GTK-Doc "
"estiver instalado e você desejar reconstruir e instalar a documentação da "
"API."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:247
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_QT6=OFF</option>: Use this parameter if <xref "
"linkend='qt6'/> is not installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_QT6=OFF</option>: Use esse parâmetro se <xref "
"linkend='qt6'/> não estiver instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:252
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_BOOST=OFF</option>: Use this parameter if you have not "
"installed <application>boost</application> (the Splash backend for Qt6 "
"recommends boost)."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_BOOST=OFF</option>: Use esse parâmetro se você não tiver "
"instalado o <application>boost</application> (a estrutura de retaguarda "
"Splash para Qt6 recomenda o boost)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_NSS3=OFF</option>: Use this parameter if you have not "
"installed <application>nss</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_NSS3=OFF</option>: Use esse parâmetro se você não tiver "
"instalado <application>nss</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:263
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_GPGME=OFF</option>: Use this parameter if you have not "
"installed <application>gpgme</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_GPGME=OFF</option>: Use esse parâmetro se você não tiver "
"instalado <application>gpgme</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:268
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_LIBTIFF=OFF</option>: Use this parameter if you have not "
"installed <application>libtiff</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_LIBTIFF=OFF</option>: Use esse parâmetro se você não tiver"
" instalado <application>libtiff</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/poppler.xml:273
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8 ninja test</command>: Runs the test suite.  The "
"environment variable LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8 is only needed if the default locale"
" does not include UTF-8."
msgstr ""
"<command>LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8 ninja test</command>: Executa a suíte de teste. "
"A variável de ambiente \"LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8\" só é necessária se a "
"localidade padrão não incluir UTF-8."

